1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,769
Free demo: raise a flock of rubber ducks.

2
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:04,983
Then defend your pond from demons.

3
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:09,574
Feed them, they grow, they drop loot, and you spend it on more ducks.

4
00:00:09,724 --> 00:00:15,001
Best part: a little devil duck in a floatie, shooting at a giant demon hand coming out of the water.

5
00:00:15,151 --> 00:00:17,946
There's even a Peaceful Mode if you just want ducks.

6
00:00:18,096 --> 00:00:22,746
The catch? The pond is a flat blue background, like an old web game.

7
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:25,874
The demo is about six hundred megabytes, English only.

8
00:00:26,024 --> 00:00:28,976
Think Insaniquarium, with rubber ducks.

9
00:00:29,126 --> 00:00:30,824
Worth a dip. Quack.

10
00:00:30,974 --> 00:00:32,202
That's Demo Dip.
